    "instructions": "Continue locally from this packed master. Set one new FILM_PHOTO_OUTPUT_DIR for prepare_top2.py and correct_top2.py; the preparation decodes the HEIC and creates a rectified text/grain atlas. Run correct_top2.py through local Blender CLI on the preceding master, then export_compact.py, reopen the master, verify_top2.py, verify_viewer.mjs and package_top2.py with the same output directory. The compact GLB remains below 10 MB; preserve all prior outputs. Copy the accepted export into public/assets/cameras/<model_id>-<sha256>.glb, retain browser_glb.path relative to ignored_generated, record repository-relative browser_glb.published_path and update the public-relative catalog asset."
